    "html": "<p>2026年11月11日 - 链接博客</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/#tags\">按标签浏览 tools.simonwillison.net</a></strong>。我一直想找到一种更好的方式来浏览我的<a>氛围编程工具集</a>（已有 244 个，还在增加）。在每周额度重置前，我还剩一些 Fable 5.2 额度，于是让它使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/tree-sitter/py-tree-sitter\">tree-sitter</a> 分析代码，找出每个工具使用的 JavaScript API、库以及 Web API 主机。</p><p>首页现在提供了标签云，可以按上述各类标签浏览：</p><p><a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/#tags\"><img alt=\"Screenshot of two tag cloud sections where tags are sized by count. Browse by JavaScript libraries - Libraries loaded from a CDN by two or more tools. Select a tag to list its tools. @google/generative-ai 3, @jsquash/avif 3, @jsquash/webp 4, Babel 2, Chart.js 2, Cropper.js 2, D3 2, DOMPurify 7, js-yaml 3, JSZip 3, Leaflet 4, markdown-it 4, Marked 12, pako 2, PDF.js 3, Pyodide 11, React 3, Tesseract.js 2, three.js 3. Browse by browser APIs - Web platform features used by each tool's own code. Select a tag to list its tools. <dialog> 5, AbortController 6, Blob URLs 38, BroadcastChannel 1, Built-in AI 1, Camera / microphone 9, Canvas 2D 44, Clipboard API 69, Compression Streams 3, createImageBitmap 2, crypto random values 4, DOMParser 8, Drag and drop 30, Dynamic import() 12, ES modules 92\" src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/tools-tag-cloud.webp\"></a></p>",
